                                    "_id": "ebe3162e4615",
                                    "content": "<h2>Request a consultation</h2><p>[FORM &mdash; build in the site's form plugin with these fields, per content/website-copy.md: First Name; Last Name; Email Address; Phone Number; Preferred Method of Contact; Case Type / Service Inquiry (dropdown); Brief Case Description; How Did You Hear About Us?; Preferred Consultation Date/Time; Privacy Notice / Consent Checkbox; CAPTCHA or security question; Submit.]</p>",
